{%- else -%}
Tool call error:
<error>
{{error}}
</error>
Every response must call the `bash` tool with {"command": "..."}.
To finish, run `echo COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT` on its own.
{%- endif %}

